{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105512","id":2467066215,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6TDHFn","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105512","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105512.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105512.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105512","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105512/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105512/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105512/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e719b47f4e95796505609986d8cee8257142a8fa","number":105512,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add convert indent on save filter option in editor settings","user":{"login":"dennmar","id":24706928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NzA2OTI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24706928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dennmar","html_url":"https://github.com/dennmar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dennmar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dennmar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dennmar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dennmar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dennmar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dennmar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dennmar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dennmar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dennmar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\nFixes #86092\r\n\r\n### Summary\r\n\r\nThese changes add a \"Convert Indent on Save Filter\" option to the editor settings under Text Editor/Behavior/Files. This filter specifies which files have their indentation automatically converted on save (if the \"Convert Indent on Save\" option is enabled).\r\n\r\nFor example, putting `*.gd` under the filter option would mean any GDScript file would have their indentation automatically converted on save. Additionally, saving wouldn't modify the indentation of a file that doesn't match the pattern (like a JSON or text file).\r\n\r\n### Backwards Compatibility\r\n\r\nSome users could rely on the current behavior where all files have their indentation automatically converted. By default, the \"Convert Indent on Save Filter\" option is left empty and any file will be automatically converted on save. \r\n\r\n### Support for Multiple File Types\r\n\r\nSince the user may want to automatically indent multiple file types, the \"Convert Indent on Save Filter\" option supports a comma-separated list. As an example, a user could specify `*.gd, *.cs, *.h, *.cpp` for the filter.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/1